        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Buy the inexpensive racial mount on a matching-race character; another race can instead earn the required city reputation.",
        acquisition = "1. Use an Alliance character with Apprentice Riding (Retail grants this at level 10). A Human can buy this racial mount without an Exalted grind; other races need Exalted with Stormwind. If already eligible, skip to step 4.\n\n2. For the reputation route, buy and equip the Stormwind Tabard from Captain Lancy Revshon beside the flight master in Stormwind City. Keep it equipped for the dungeon kills in step 3.\n\n3. On a character strong enough to solo it, enter The Botanica in Netherstorm on Normal difficulty (71.5, 55.5). Clear the enemies and bosses with the tabard equipped, use the exit behind Warp Splinter, reset outside and repeat until Stormwind is Exalted. Wait if you hit the hourly instance limit.\n\n4. Visit Katie Stokx in Stormwind City, Old Town (77.0, 67.8). Buy Brown Horse Bridle; its base price is 1 gold, reduced by reputation discounts.\n\n5. Use Brown Horse Bridle from your bags to learn Brown Horse. Open Collections > Mounts and search for Brown Horse; it is shared with eligible Alliance characters on your account.",
