        acquisition = "1. Use an Alliance character with Apprentice Riding (Retail grants this at level 10). A Gnome can buy this racial mount without an Exalted grind; other races need Exalted with Gnomeregan. If already eligible, skip to step 4.\n\n2. For the reputation route, buy and equip the Gnomeregan Tabard from Master Tinker Trini beside the flight master in Ironforge. Keep it equipped for the dungeon kills in step 3.\n\n3. On a character strong enough to solo it, enter The Botanica in Netherstorm on Normal difficulty (71.5, 55.5). Clear the enemies and bosses with the tabard equipped, use the exit behind Warp Splinter, reset outside and repeat until Gnomeregan is Exalted. Wait if you hit the hourly instance limit.\n\n4. Visit Milli Featherwhistle in Dun Morogh, Steelgrill's Depot (49.1, 48.0). Buy Unpainted Mechanostrider; its base price is 1 gold, reduced by reputation discounts.\n\n5. Use Unpainted Mechanostrider from your bags to learn Unpainted Mechanostrider. Open Collections > Mounts and search for Unpainted Mechanostrider; it is shared with eligible Alliance characters on your account.",
